**Date**: 2026-09-07
**Status**: Approved
**Author**: NMG

Feature: Exact suffix in the fresh nmg-sdlc 372 delivery fixture
  @SCN001
  Scenario: Append exact suffix to each completed greeting
    Given a valid name and an exact mixed-case suffix
    When the CLI combines suffix with uppercase prefix repetition and no-newline
    Then each completed greeting has the verbatim suffix
    And repetition separators and final-newline behavior are preserved

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Preserve existing default and error behavior
    Given an omitted or empty suffix and an invalid-name case
    When the CLI is invoked
    Then omitted and empty suffix preserve current successful output
    And invalid names exit one without any stdout greeting or suffix
    And help documents the optional suffix
